/target
.idea

# Secrets and key material. A Solana keypair JSON is an unencrypted private key, and a single
# accidental `git add` publishes a signing authority irrecoverably; environment files routinely hold
# RPC tokens. Ignore the shapes those files actually take, and keep committed examples allowed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*-keypair.json
*_keypair.json
keypair.json
id.json
